# Testing Conventions

- Add tests for auth flow transitions and protected-route behavior.
- Add tests for API error handling paths in critical user journeys.
- Prioritize tests around `src/modules/auth/pages/login` and `src/modules/auth/pages/impersonate`.

## Required patterns

- New critical flows should include at least one happy-path and one failure-path test.
- Keep tests close to module page ownership when possible.

## Prohibited patterns

- Refactors of critical flows with no regression tests.
- Tests that rely on unrelated global state when local setup is possible.
